    "detailed_description": "BlockUrbs is a small city builder sandbox toy where you can play freely without worrying about progression, resource management or scoring. You can place variety of structures like houses, residential buildings, commercial buildings, sport grounds, industries, restaurants, trees, hospitals and roads on tiles of various sizes to create detailed and beautiful city section.<br><br>There are 3 types of tiles to choose in BlockUrbs<br>- Green<br>- Desert<br>- Cold<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106290/extras/b2c9523f555bacec79772bb36567cd7f.poster.avif?t=1727110840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106290/extras/b2c9523f555bacec79772bb36567cd7f.webm?t=1727110840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>You can choose from following 5 tile sizes <br>- XS (4x4)<br>- S (6x6)<br>- M (8x8)<br>- L (10x10)<br>- XL (12x12)<br><br>Also, you can unlock additional structures by completing the optional objectives.<br><br>Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback or queries. Thanks!",
    "about_the_game": "BlockUrbs is a small city builder sandbox toy where you can play freely without worrying about progression, resource management or scoring. You can place variety of structures like houses, residential buildings, commercial buildings, sport grounds, industries, restaurants, trees, hospitals and roads on tiles of various sizes to create detailed and beautiful city section.<br><br>There are 3 types of tiles to choose in BlockUrbs<br>- Green<br>- Desert<br>- Cold<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106290/extras/b2c9523f555bacec79772bb36567cd7f.poster.avif?t=1727110840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106290/extras/b2c9523f555bacec79772bb36567cd7f.webm?t=1727110840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>You can choose from following 5 tile sizes <br>- XS (4x4)<br>- S (6x6)<br>- M (8x8)<br>- L (10x10)<br>- XL (12x12)<br><br>Also, you can unlock additional structures by completing the optional objectives.<br><br>Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback or queries. Thanks!",
